プできます。\n```","ts":"1632209533.262000","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"25a30dd8-635e-4b90-8d48-ed799eb52c7e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h function-list","ts":"1632209533.261900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98RZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a58eb8fb-5091-4d57-b2b4-ec0057b99b34","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ブール値が欲しかったら`\"hoge\" =~# \"ho\"`みたいにするのがいいと思います","ts":"1632209494.261500","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1632209505.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5Nc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"295f1488-6f1c-4bc1-9969-9beae2b2b760","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"あ、逆","ts":"1632209395.260200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tk6Y"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nmatch({expr}, {pat} [, {start} [, {count}]])                    *match()*\n                {expr}がリストの場合は、{pat}にマッチする最初の要素のインデッ\n                クスを返す。各要素は文字列として扱われる。リストと辞書はechoし\n                たときと同じように文字列表現に変換される。\n \n                それ以外の場合は、{expr}は文字列として扱われる。{expr}の中で\n                {pat}にマッチするインデックス(バイト単位のオフセット)を表す数\n                値を返す。\n \n                最初の文字またはリストの最初の要素にマッチしたときは0を返す。\n                マッチがないときは-1を返す。\n \n                サブマッチを取得するには |matchlist()| を参照。\n                例:  \n                        :echo match(\"testing\", \"ing\")   \" 結果は 4\n                        :echo match([1, 'x'], '\\a')     \" 結果は 1\n                {pat}の扱われ方については|string-match|を参照。\n```","ts":"1632209395.260100","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"076F4978-C524-4ADA-AE8C-26131745876B","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h match()","ts":"1632209395.260000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"onm"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                        *expr-==*  *expr-!=*  *expr-\u0026gt;*   *expr-\u0026gt;=*\n                        *expr-\u0026lt;*   *expr-\u0026lt;=*  *expr-=~*  *expr-!~*\n                        *expr-==#* *expr-!=#* *expr-\u0026gt;#*  *expr-\u0026gt;=#*\n                        *expr-\u0026lt;#*  *expr-\u0026lt;=#* *expr-=~#* *expr-!~#*\n                        *expr-==?* *expr-!=?* *expr-\u0026gt;?*  *expr-\u0026gt;=?*\n                        *expr-\u0026lt;?*  *expr-\u0026lt;=?* *expr-=~?* *expr-!~?*\n                        *expr-is* *expr-isnot* *expr-is#* *expr-isnot#*\n                        *expr-is?* *expr-isnot?*\n                'ignorecase'次第   大小文字考慮    大小文字無視  \n等しい                  ==              ==#             ==?\n等しくない              !=              !=#             !=?\nより大きい              \u0026gt;               \u0026gt;#              \u0026gt;?\nより大きいか等しい      \u0026gt;=              \u0026gt;=#             \u0026gt;=?\nより小さい              \u0026lt;               \u0026lt;#              \u0026lt;?\nより小さいか等しい      \u0026lt;=              \u0026lt;=#             \u0026lt;=?\n正規表現マッチ          =~              =~#             =~?\n正規表現非マッチ        !~              !~#             !~?\n同一のインスタンス      is              is#             is?\n異なるインスタンス      isnot           isnot#          isnot?\n \n例:\n\"abc\" ==# \"Abc\"   0と評価される\n\"abc\" ==? \"Abc\"   1と評価される\n\"abc\" == \"Abc\"    'ignorecase' が設定されていれば1と、でなければ0と評価\n```","ts":"1632209382.259500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"ad4c2c93-921b-41a3-82d9-0b59872bae6c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h !~#","ts":"1632209382.259400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Elh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d9134b4-8e45-4e7b-bef1-d50113f414dc","type":"message","user":"UQ3F5HZEZ","text":"初歩的な質問にはなりますが、文字列と正規表現を受け取り、文字列が正規表現にマッチしていれば真、していなければ偽を返すvimの関数はありますか。\nまた、皆さんは期待している機能を持った関数があるかどうかどのように調べていますか。","ts":"1632209354.259000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Me+Md"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"\u003c@U023H98P3N0\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1632203810.258800","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"type":"message","user":"U02F181EM42","text":"\u003c@U02F181EM42\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1632158323.258600","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
